{{Quote|text=}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the ex-guard of the [[Stardew:Witch's Hut|Witch's hut]]. The player first meets Henchman during the [[Stardew:Quests#List of Story Quests|Goblin Problem Quest]].

Sometime after completing this quest, the player receives a letter from Henchman saying he lost his job because the player took the magic ink, and is now requesting their help in the [[Forbidden Maze|Marshlands]]. Once the player helps the Henchman, he becomes a giftable NPC.

